      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef isValid(word: str) -> bool:\n    if len(word) < 3:\n        return False\n    \n    vowels = set(\"aeiouAEIOU\")\n    has_vowel = False\n    has_consonant = False\n    \n    for char in word:\n        if not char.isalnum():\n            return False\n        \n        if char.isalpha():\n            if char in vowels:\n                has_vowel = True\n            else:\n                has_consonant = True\n                \n    return has_vowel and has_consonant\n```",
