      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minExtraChar(s: str, dictionary: list[str]) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    word_set = set(dictionary)\n    # dp[i] will store the minimum extra characters for the prefix s[0...i-1]\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        # Option 1: The current character s[i-1] is treated as an extra character\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + 1\n        \n        # Option 2: Check if any substring ending at i-1 exists in the dictionary\n        for j in range(i):\n            # substring from index j to i-1\n            if s[j:i] in word_set:\n                dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[j])\n                \n    return dp[n]\n```",
