      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef areaOfMaxDiagonalRectangle(dimensions):\n    max_diag_sq = 0\n    max_area = 0\n    \n    for length, width in dimensions:\n        # We use diagonal squared (l^2 + w^2) to avoid floating point issues with sqrt\n        diag_sq = length**2 + width**2\n        area = length * width\n        \n        if diag_sq > max_diag_sq:\n            max_diag_sq = diag_sq\n            max_area = area\n        elif diag_sq == max_diag_sq:\n            if area > max_area:\n                max_area = area\n                \n    return max_area\n```",
