      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef sumOfTheDigitsOfHarshadNumber(x: int) -> int:\n    # Calculate the sum of the digits of x\n    sum_digits = sum(int(digit) for digit in str(x))\n    \n    # Check if x is divisible by the sum of its digits\n    if x % sum_digits == 0:\n        return sum_digits\n    else:\n        return -1\n```",
