      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef beautifulSubstrings(s: str, k: int) -> int:\n    vowels_set = set('aeiou')\n    n = len(s)\n    count = 0\n    \n    # Since the constraints are small (s.length <= 1000), \n    # an O(n^2) solution is acceptable.\n    for i in range(n):\n        vowels = 0\n        consonants = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            if s[j] in vowels_set:\n                vowels += 1\n            else:\n                consonants += 1\n            \n            # A string is beautiful if:\n            # 1. vowels == consonants\n            # 2. (vowels * consonants) % k == 0\n            if vowels == consonants:\n                if (vowels * consonants) % k == 0:\n                    count += 1\n                    \n    return count\n```",
