      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef permutationDifference(s: str, t: str) -> int:\n    # Create a mapping of each character in s to its index\n    pos_s = {char: i for i, char in enumerate(s)}\n    \n    total_diff = 0\n    # Iterate through t and calculate the absolute difference in indices\n    for i, char in enumerate(t):\n        total_diff += abs(pos_s[char] - i)\n        \n    return total_diff\n```",
