    "prediction": "google/gemma-4-31b-it",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumPairs(words):\n    seen = set()\n    pairs = 0\n    for word in words:\n        # Create the reversed version of the current word\n        reversed_word = word[::-1]\n        # If the reversed version has been seen before, it forms a pair\n        if reversed_word in seen:\n            pairs += 1\n            # Remove the matched word so it cannot be reused\n            seen.remove(reversed_word)\n        else:\n            # Otherwise, add the current word to the set of available words\n            seen.add(word)\n    return pairs\n```",
