    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read all input data from stdin\n    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not input_data:\n        return\n    \n    # Parse N and M\n    N = int(input_data[0])\n    M = int(input_data[1])\n    \n    # Parse problem scores A_i\n    A = []\n    for i in range(M):\n        A.append(int(input_data[2 + i]))\n        \n    # Parse player solution strings S_i\n    S = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        S.append(input_data[2 + M + i])\n        \n    # Calculate current total scores for all players\n    # Current score = sum of solved problems' scores + player index (1-indexed)\n    current_scores = []\n    for i in range(N):\n        score = 0\n        for j in range(M):\n            if S[i][j] == 'o':\n                score += A[j]\n        score += (i + 1)\n        current_scores.append(score)\n        \n    # Process each player i\n    for i in range(N):\n        # Identify problems player i has NOT solved\n        unsolved_problems = []\n        for j in range(M):\n            if S[i][j] == 'x':\n                unsolved_problems.append(A[j])\n        \n        # Sort unsolved problems in descending order to reach target faster\n        unsolved_problems.sort(reverse=True)\n        \n        # Find the maximum score among all other players\n        max_other_score = -1\n        for k in range(N):\n            if k == i:\n                continue\n            if current_scores[k] > max_other_score:\n                max_other_score = current_scores[k]\n        \n        # Determine how many problems player i needs to solve to exceed max_other_score\n        current_player_score = current_scores[i]\n        count = 0\n        \n        # If the player is already leading, count is 0\n        # Otherwise, add the highest value problems until score > max_other_score\n        while current_player_score <= max_other_score:\n            current_player_score += unsolved_problems[count]\n            count += 1\n            \n        print(count)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n```",
