      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_boxes(apple, capacity):\n    # Calculate the total number of apples that need to be stored\n    total_apples = sum(apple)\n    \n    # Sort the box capacities in descending order to minimize the number of boxes used\n    capacity.sort(reverse=True)\n    \n    current_capacity = 0\n    boxes_count = 0\n    \n    # Iterate through the sorted boxes and add their capacity until it meets or exceeds total_apples\n    for cap in capacity:\n        current_capacity += cap\n        boxes_count += 1\n        if current_capacity >= total_apples:\n            return boxes_count\n            \n    return boxes_count\n```",
