      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef maxFrequencyElements(nums):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the total frequencies of elements in nums that have the maximum frequency.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = Counter(nums)\n    max_freq = max(counts.values())\n    \n    # Total frequency is (number of elements with max_freq) * max_freq\n    total_max_freq = sum(freq for freq in counts.values() if freq == max_freq)\n    \n    return total_max_freq\n```",
