ific provided options, this is likely a question about which keys in a specific set (possibly a finger table calculation) $N_6$ would track. For $N_6$, fingers are at $(6+2^0)=7, (6+2^1)=8, (6+2^2)=10, (6+2^3)=14$. The successors for these keys are: $7 \\to N_8$, $8 \\to N_8$, $10 \\to N_{12}$, $14 \\to N_3$. The target keys themselves are $7, 8, 10, 14$.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
