      "generated_answer": "To find the total storage required, multiply the given values:\nTotal bytes = 3,000,000 books × 400 pages/book × 50 lines/page × 10 words/line × 5 characters/word × 1 byte/character.\nTotal bytes = $3 \\times 10^6 \\times 400 \\times 50 \\times 10 \\times 5 = 3 \\times 10^6 \\times 1,000,000 = 3 \\times 10^{12}$ bytes.\nSince $10^{12}$ bytes corresponds to a Terabyte, the storage is best measured in Terabytes.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
