    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Given 3 Colors whose RGB representations are given as follows: Color 1: (0.5, 0.5, 0.5), Color 2: (0.4, 0.6, 0.5), Color 3: (0.3, 0.7, 0.5), Which Color does not carry chrominance (Color) Information? Answer with 1 or 2 or 3.\n\nOptions: \nA. None of the above\nB. Both 1 and 2\nC. Both 2 and 3\nD. All of the above\nE. 3\nF. 1\nG. Only 1 and 2 carry chrominance information\nH. 2\nI. Only 2 and 3 carry chrominance information\nJ. Both 1 and 3\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
