    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In a skewed smooth distribution with a tail exended to the left, the statistic with the highest value is the\n\nOptions: \nA. median\nB. interquartile range\nC. geometric mean\nD. quartile deviation\nE. variance\nF. range\nG. standard deviation\nH. mean\nI. mode\nJ. harmonic mean\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
