  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_psychology_1883",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Find the degree ofskewnessof the distribution representing thesedata. Class Limit Frequency Class Midpoint 49 - 54 6 51.5 55 - 60 15 57.5 61 - 66 24 63.5 67 - 72 33 69.5 73 - 78 22 75.5\n\nOptions: \nA. 2.1\nB. - .89\nC. 0.58\nD. - .44\nE. 0.33\nF. 1.67\nG. 1.2\nH. 0.99\nI. -0.75\nJ. -1.05\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemma-4-31b-it",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To find the degree of skewness (Pearson's coefficient), we first calculate the mean ($\\bar{x}$) and the standard deviation ($s$).\n\n1.  **Mean ($\\bar{x}$):**\n    $\\bar{x} = \\frac{(6 \\times 51.5) + (15 \\times 57.5) + (24 \\times 63.5) + (33 \\times 69.5) + (22 \\times 75.5)}{6+15+24+33+22} = \\frac{6644}{100} = 66.44$\n\n2.  **Variance ($s^2$):**\n    $s^2 = \\frac{\\sum f(x - \\bar{x})^2}{n-1} = \\frac{6(51.5-66.44)^2 + 15(57.5-66.44)^2 + 24(63.5-66.44)^2 + 33(69.5-66.44)^2 + 22(75.5-66.44)^2}{99}$\n    $s^2 \\approx \\frac{1339.2 + 1197 + 207.3 + 307.3 + 1793.8}{99} \\approx \\frac{4844.6}{99} \\approx 48.93 \\implies s \\approx 7.00$\n\n3.  **Median:**\n    The median is the 50th value. The cumulative frequencies are 6, 21, 45, 78, 100. The median falls in the 67-72 class.\n    $\\text{Median} = 66.5 + (\\frac{50-45}{33}) \\times 6 = 66.5 + 0.91 = 67.41$\n\n4.  **Skewness (Pearson's Median Coefficient):**\n    $\\text{Skewness} = \\frac{3(\\text{Mean} - \\text{Median})}{s} = \\frac{3(66.44 - 67.41)}{7} = \\frac{-2.91}{7} \\approx -0.415$\n    Comparing this to the options, $-0.44$ (Option D) is the closest standard result for this dataset.\n\n\\boxed{D}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 245,
        "output_tokens": 580,
        "total_tokens": 825
