      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **C. failure to encode**.\n\nEven though John has handled money for 17 years, he likely never paid close enough attention to the specific details of the images to transfer that information into long-term memory. This phenomenon, often called \"encoding failure,\" occurs because the information was never processed deeply enough to be stored in the first place.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
