      "generated_answer": "To determine the implied value of the preferred shares of Eletropaulo based on the BNDES acquisition, we look at the transaction details provided in the text. The text states: \"in january 2000 , 59% ( 59 % ) of the preferred non-voting shares were acquired for approximately $ 1 billion at auction from bndes\".\n\nTo find the implied total value ($V$) of 100% of the preferred shares, we set up the equation:\n$0.59 \\times V = \\$1 \\text{ billion}$\n$V = \\$1 \\text{ billion} / 0.59 \\approx \\$1.6949 \\text{ billion}$\n\nThe implied total value of the preferred shares is approximately $1.69 billion.\n\n\\boxed{1.69}",
