      "generated_answer": "The federal court will most likely dismiss the action because the issues are not ripe. Ripeness requires that a plaintiff be facing a concrete, immediate threat of harm; here, the law does not even become effective until January 1, 2010, and the suit was filed on December 1, 2009. Because the law has not yet gone into effect, there is no immediate threat of injury or concrete dispute to resolve.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
