    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This book argues that, while the sciences of nature were born from the practices of investigation, the sciences of man arose from examination.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
