    "global index": "GeoBench_1012",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: According to the demographic transition model, as a country moves from an agricultural to an industrial base, what form of migration of people decreases in occurance?\n\nOptions: \nA. Voluntary migration\nB. Intraregional migration\nC. Transhumance\nD. Cyclic migration\nE. Transmigration\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-3-flash-preview",
